          "text": "Keep secret keys out of your project files. The deploy leaves .env files out of the upload, and you can add keys as environment variables, which Embarko stores write-only so nobody can read them back. Also remember that anyone with your link can open the site, so if it uses your AI key, set a spending limit with your AI provider if they offer one."
